## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1 — Fix "No Questions Found" Bug

The error occurs at [AITestImporter.tsx:L1155](file:///d:/ziptrip/projects/nkc-test/frontend/src/pages/AITestImporter.tsx#L1155) when `parsedData.questions` is empty. Root causes:
1. Gemini returns empty/malformed JSON → [_parse_response](file:///d:/ziptrip/projects/nkc-test/backend/ai_preview_importer/pdf_vision_pipeline.py#979-1088) raises `ValueError`
2. All batches fail silently (caught at line 793) → `all_questions` stays empty
3. No retry logic — a single API failure kills the entire extraction

