### Phase 5 — Error Recovery & Robustness

#### [MODIFY] [pdf_vision_pipeline.py](file:///d:/ziptrip/projects/nkc-test/backend/ai_preview_importer/pdf_vision_pipeline.py)

- **Retry logic:** New `_call_gemini_with_retry(content_parts, max_retries=3)` helper
  - Attempt 1: Normal call
  - Attempt 2: Increase `max_output_tokens` to 100K, slightly higher temperature
  - Attempt 3: Simplify prompt (remove image extraction instructions, focus on text)
- **Rate limit handling:** Detect `429` status, wait `retry-after` seconds
- **Batch recovery:** If a batch fails all retries, split into single-page sub-batches and retry each
- **JSON repair:** Improve [_repair_truncated_json](file:///d:/ziptrip/projects/nkc-test/backend/ai_preview_importer/pdf_vision_pipeline.py#935-977) to handle more edge cases

